Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.63,0:00:04.31,Default,VOUCHE,0,0,0,,You're really quite amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.75,0:00:10.27,Default,VOUCHE,0,0,0,,You're the attendant to the demon \Nking and his daughter, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.81,0:00:15.48,Default,VOUCHE,0,0,0,,I'm very proud to say that we went \Nto demon school together, Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.49,0:00:18.87,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,There's {\i1}nothing{\i0} to be proud of!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:23.93,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I can't get Lady Doux \Nto pass a single trial,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.93,0:00:28.43,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,and no matter how much I teach her, \Nshe's not turning more demon-like at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.30,0:00:33.60,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Seriously, Lady Doux... will you \Never become a full-fledged demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.79,0:00:42.35,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm just... a totally useless attendant!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:53.22,italics,VOUCHE,0,0,0,,It must be rough working for the royals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:55.95,italics,VOUCHE,0,0,0,,I wish she'd knock it off \Nwith the drunk crying though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.73,0:01:03.19,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,One more!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:39.51,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Demon King's Daughter Is Trying \Nto Change Her Image Too Much!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.27,0:02:39.51,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE DEMON KING'S DAUGHTER IS TRYING \NTO CHANGE HER IMAGE TOO MUCH!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.97,0:02:41.52,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.31,0:02:46.48,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,My bedhead's all weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.87,0:02:49.12,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.12,0:02:53.58,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,No! His Majesty's daughter mustn't\Nwalk around with her hair like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.58,0:02:56.91,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Now, now, it's quite all right, Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.41,0:03:01.00,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,It's not like she's doing \Nanything nice or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.00,0:03:02.01,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.01,0:03:03.25,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.25,0:03:04.04,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.42,0:03:06.30,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That's what I mean when I \Nsay you're not demon-like!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.71,0:03:08.00,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.31,0:03:09.84,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.08,0:03:11.81,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,A-Again...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.81,0:03:16.22,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It's not just kindness. It's how you \Nspeak and look, as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.46,0:03:21.94,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,If she's going to become a full-fledged \Ndemon, we need to fix these things, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.94,0:03:23.22,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:26.23,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You're indeed correct. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.48,0:03:35.44,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Would you wipe that \Ngrin off of your face?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.99,0:03:41.63,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,But it's going to take a while to \Nadjust the way she speaks, won't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.63,0:03:44.37,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,We've had no luck with that so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.73,0:03:48.00,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Then let's start by \Nchanging her appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.09,0:03:49.96,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Her appearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.29,0:03:53.68,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We will have Lady Doux undergo \Na transformation trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.09,0:03:58.72,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,First I'm gonna draw this roundy round...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.05,0:04:01.99,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,And then these pointy points...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.37,0:04:03.47,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,All done!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.79,0:04:08.23,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Very good. You should be able to \Nactivate the spell using this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.71,0:04:11.20,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I can transform with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.20,0:04:12.99,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We're still preparing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:14.66,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,In order to transform,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.66,0:04:16.11,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,you'll need to enter the magic circle
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.11,0:04:18.65,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,while imagining the form you \Nwant to transform into,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.65,0:04:20.82,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,then say the incantation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:23.16,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux, do you see that over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.19,0:04:28.49,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the old guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.49,0:04:32.00,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,They are repairing the areas that \Nwere broken during training.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:33.09,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,And now, Lady Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:34.84,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.58,0:04:38.73,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux, you will \Ntransform into a monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.73,0:04:43.14,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,attack those slaves, and \Nrule over them with fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.55,0:04:45.51,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That is your trial this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.99,0:04:48.14,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,What kind of monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:50.02,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Allow me to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.74,0:04:52.94,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Variant!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.13,0:05:00.86,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:09.58,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You look super strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.31,0:05:11.62,italics,MONSTER JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.62,0:05:14.82,italics,MONSTER JAHI,0,0,0,,You transform to make yourself \Nlook stronger and terrifying
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:17.75,italics,MONSTER JAHI,0,0,0,,and to hide your weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.75,0:05:19.72,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hide your weakness?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:24.03,italics,MONSTER JAHI,0,0,0,,Now, Lady Doux, give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.03,0:05:25.51,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.15,0:05:29.18,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.18,0:05:32.18,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,A monster, a monster...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.18,0:05:35.56,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,The same kinda monster as Big Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.21,0:05:40.51,italics,MONSTER JAHI,0,0,0,,She should be able to imagine this \Nnow that I've shown her an example.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.51,0:05:43.95,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'll make sure she transforms properly \Nand make today's trial a success!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.45,0:05:48.46,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Variant!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.22,0:05:56.62,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Heh, I got a tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.62,0:05:59.05,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Don't, "I got a tail," me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:01.63,italics,MONSTER JAHI,0,0,0,,Did you actually imagine \Nyour form properly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.63,0:06:03.30,italics,MONSTER JAHI,0,0,0,,You need to look harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.59,0:06:04.97,italics,MONSTER JAHI,0,0,0,,Like these fangs!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.67,0:06:08.06,italics,MONSTER JAHI,0,0,0,,And these wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.42,0:06:11.06,italics,MONSTER JAHI,0,0,0,,These giant ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.01,0:06:13.19,Default,MONSTER JAHI,0,0,0,,That's bedhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.73,0:06:14.81,italics,MONSTER JAHI,0,0,0,,These horns...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.10,0:06:16.12,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Horns?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.73,0:06:20.82,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hmm... This might be a little hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.79,0:06:22.69,italics,MONSTER JAHI,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.09,0:06:25.20,italics,MONSTER JAHI,0,0,0,,She's turning more and more \Ninto some mascot character.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.79,0:06:35.04,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.04,0:06:38.21,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux should have \Nmore than enough mana...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.65,0:06:40.30,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,So why...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.30,0:06:41.78,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.01,0:06:44.47,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I've got {\i1}three{\i0} horns!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:49.47,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Jahi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:51.99,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,It looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:55.98,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to use \Nthe ace up my sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.30,0:06:57.98,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.98,0:07:00.04,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is the Flower of Transfiguration
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:02.69,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,that His Majesty gave \Nme before this trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.27,0:07:05.95,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It's a flower that only blooms \Nonce every twenty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.95,0:07:08.35,flashback,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Just by covering yourself with its pollen,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.35,0:07:11.36,flashback,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,you can transform into a giant monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.70,0:07:15.33,flashback,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Use it in an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.59,0:07:20.63,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This flower is rare, so I was hoping \Nyou'd be able to transform on your own...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.63,0:07:21.84,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,but you leave me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.60,0:07:34.18,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Now, Lady Doux, this time you \Nwill successfully transform...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.18,0:07:38.23,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,and show the humans just... how \Nt-terrifying demons can be...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:44.31,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'm a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.31,0:07:46.74,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,No, you just got bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.74,0:07:48.69,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,D-Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.69,0:07:52.24,Default,ADULT C,0,0,0,,Wow, why'd she get so big?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.47,0:07:55.87,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Everyone! I'm a big monster now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.87,0:07:57.86,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Rawr!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.17,0:08:01.00,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Ah, Lady Doux! Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.51,0:08:04.52,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,"DOUX'S MARCH"\NLYRICS: KANATA NAKAMURA\NCOMPOSITION AND ARRANGEMENT: TAKERU TAKEMIYA\NSONG: DOUX
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.69,0:08:09.38,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,There Doux goes on her march
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.52,0:08:13.53,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Lookee, Lookee, I turned all big
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.78,0:08:17.28,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,There Doux goes on her march
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.66,0:08:21.41,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Just look at how big I got
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.66,0:08:25.29,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Every little thing is just so small
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:29.29,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Papa and Big Sister are also small
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.67,0:08:33.30,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Everyone's so cute and small
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.66,0:08:37.62,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,I'll let you all ride on my back
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.73,0:08:49.40,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,There Doux goes on her march
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.63,0:08:53.44,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Lookee, Lookee, I turned all big
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.68,0:08:57.32,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,There Doux goes on her march
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.70,0:09:01.41,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Just look at how big I got
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.65,0:09:05.29,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Every little thing is just so small
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.65,0:09:09.42,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Even Ms. Salamandra is so small
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.65,0:09:13.42,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,The castle's all tiny, too
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.66,0:09:17.66,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Now I can't get into my room
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.70,0:09:29.54,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,The fact that her body's gotten bigger
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.54,0:09:31.38,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,must also mean that she's gotten stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.76,0:09:34.76,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux! Pulverize those slaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.39,0:09:41.27,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,Doux's heading this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.27,0:09:43.95,Default,ADULT B,0,0,0,,She's so cute even at that size.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.95,0:09:45.74,Default,ADULT A,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.27,0:09:50.28,Default,ADULT A,0,0,0,,Get away from the cliff! \NA boulder's about to fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.63,0:09:51.53,Default,ASSIM/ADULT B,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.05,0:10:01.00,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:01.75,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.14,0:10:09.92,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,W-We're saved...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:11.70,Default,ADULT B,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you, Lady Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.70,0:10:13.47,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,Doux, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.17,0:10:17.92,Default,ADULT B,0,0,0,,L-L-L-Lady Doux?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.92,0:10:19.26,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.66,0:10:21.80,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,We're fine thanks to you, Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.80,0:10:24.73,Default,ADULT B,0,0,0,,More importantly, are \Nyou okay, Lady Doux?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.73,0:10:27.87,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup! Doux is really strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.87,0:10:29.07,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay, bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.95,0:10:33.47,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.47,0:10:35.61,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I can't believe you \Nsaved the humans again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.98,0:10:40.78,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I haven't been able to teach \NLady Doux a single thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.78,0:10:43.41,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I guess I don't deserve to be \Ntheir attendant after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.53,0:10:46.59,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.84,0:10:53.13,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,L-Lady Doux?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:55.15,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I-It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.15,0:10:57.39,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It doesn't hurt! It doesn't hurt at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.32,0:11:04.23,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I didn't... cry in front of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.23,0:11:04.89,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.69,0:11:08.40,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Because... I transformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.84,0:11:09.93,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Transformed...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.77,0:11:14.98,flashback italics,MONSTER JAHI,0,0,0,,You transform to make yourself \Nlook stronger and terrifying
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.98,0:11:17.91,flashback italics,MONSTER JAHI,0,0,0,,and to hide your weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.35,0:11:21.03,flashback,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hide your weakness?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:25.16,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I see... So she {\i0}was{\i1} listening to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.55,0:11:28.51,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes. You did very well hiding your pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.51,0:11:30.13,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.60,0:11:32.38,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You're very strong, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:35.88,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,So a bump like this is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.46,0:11:44.14,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup! It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.31,0:11:46.51,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm fine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.51,0:11:53.28,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.28,0:11:55.61,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Doux?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.61,0:11:57.99,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,How'd you get that bump on your head?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.56,0:12:02.06,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,What in the world happened, Doux?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.13,0:12:09.00,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,XXX IS TOO PERFECT A JOB FOR A PAIRIKA!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:09.00,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"XXX Is Too Perfect a Job for a Pairika!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:10.88,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,WE DELIVER EVERYWHERE: DEMON WORLD DELIVERY DRIVERS\NHIGH PAY!! LOOKING FOR DRIVERS
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.95,0:12:11.36,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,"High pay!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.36,0:12:14.57,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,"We deliver everywhere: Demon \NWorld Delivery Drivers."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.91,0:12:17.38,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,But I don't have my license...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.93,0:12:20.48,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,"Work anytime twenty-four hours!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.48,0:12:23.43,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,"Demon World Convenience Store \Nclerk. Training time included."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.43,0:12:25.39,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,That sounds like a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.39,0:12:30.16,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,LOOKING FOR MONSTER BREEDERS\NEXPERIENCE NEEDED
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.39,0:12:27.71,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,"Experience needed"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.71,0:12:30.27,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Everyone has to start off somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.27,0:12:33.72,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,All of these suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.72,0:12:38.19,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,There has to be one somewhere, \Nright? A job just for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.19,0:12:39.95,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.40,0:12:43.95,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hey, hey. Show me a new prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:45.52,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.63,0:12:53.71,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,So you've finally come, Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.96,0:12:57.09,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Now, fight the great Thaiti!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.09,0:12:59.09,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,We'll compete over the position \Nof royal attendant!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.78,0:13:05.71,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Okay, Lady Doux, let's \Ngo head to your trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.37,0:13:10.85,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Don't you ignore me! You meatheaded woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.17,0:13:14.12,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Don't come at me, you oaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:15.61,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What are you even talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.86,0:13:18.36,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Also, what happened to your Pairika job?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:21.49,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:22.70,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.17,0:13:26.70,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,You remember that trial of \Nseduction we did, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.29,0:13:29.62,flashback,MAN,0,0,0,,Go back home and \Nsuck on your mommy's teats.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.62,0:13:32.54,flashback,THAITI,0,0,0,,I'll murder you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.54,0:13:36.88,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,That's when I realized that I'm \Njust not suited for seduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.63,0:13:40.48,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.49,0:13:42.83,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.11,0:13:46.93,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,It's a huge success!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:49.94,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I made this with Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.94,0:13:51.18,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.18,0:13:52.63,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.63,0:13:56.06,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Ever since then, Doux's acknowledged \Nme as her master in pranks, and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.06,0:13:58.40,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,we've been playing together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.61,0:14:02.15,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,That's when it hit me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.58,0:14:06.07,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,that {\i1}I{\i0} should actually \Nbe Doux's attendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.07,0:14:09.53,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Yes, I absolutely should be!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.53,0:14:11.04,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,This little...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.33,0:14:13.08,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,That's why we're going to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.08,0:14:16.91,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,I'll prove that I'm better \N as her attendant!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.10,0:14:21.42,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hey, look. I made this with Master, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.86,0:14:24.02,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Sit, sit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.18,0:14:33.74,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.74,0:14:35.19,Default,DOUX/THAITI,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.83,0:14:40.19,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Master's pranks are the best! The best!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.19,0:14:41.94,top,JAHI,0,0,0,,All right. I accept!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.94,0:14:43.90,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.90,0:14:47.85,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,But only if the condition is whoever \Nloses won't meet with Lady Doux again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.85,0:14:51.02,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Oh? Are you really okay with \Nadding a condition like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.02,0:14:51.98,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.14,0:14:59.96,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Because there's absolutely no \Nchance that you'll defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.23,0:15:02.38,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.50,0:15:07.93,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.30,0:15:11.93,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Hup, hup. Hup, hup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.93,0:15:13.45,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Hup, hup, hup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.45,0:15:16.51,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Hup, hup, huppity, hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.85,0:15:17.90,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.90,0:15:20.91,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Wow, that's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.91,0:15:23.49,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,You've made such a mess so \Nquickly just by using magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.97,0:15:26.36,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Thank you for your \Nassistance, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.36,0:15:29.25,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Oh, it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.25,0:15:31.90,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,This is for your battle, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.90,0:15:33.58,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yeah! Battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.78,0:15:37.27,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,W-W-Wait. Is this battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.37,0:15:40.21,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.49,0:15:42.80,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,We're going to compete by \Ndoing household chores!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.35,0:15:45.97,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wha?! Why would we do chores?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.23,0:15:47.57,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.57,0:15:51.62,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,I mean, weak little me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.62,0:15:54.98,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,wouldn't stand a chance in some \Nbattle of magic or strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.56,0:16:00.94,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Not to mention a real lady like me can't \Nstand the sight of blood and guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.54,0:16:05.57,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,This is going to be fair and smart. \NThat's how we'll do things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.96,0:16:08.07,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You're gonna fairly smash each \Nother like sumo wrestlers?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.09,0:16:08.07,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,DOSUKOI!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:10.82,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,I said {\i1}fair{\i0} and {\i1}smart{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.66,0:16:13.12,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Whatever. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:15.62,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Okay! First, we're going to clean!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:19.33,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,You do the right half and \NI'll do the left half.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.33,0:16:22.13,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Whoever cleans everything quicker wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.93,0:16:25.04,italics,THAITI,0,0,0,,You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.04,0:16:26.37,italics,THAITI,0,0,0,,I already know that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.37,0:16:29.23,italics,THAITI,0,0,0,,you leave basically all the \Ncleaning to your housekeeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.55,0:16:31.85,italics,THAITI,0,0,0,,This battle is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.57,0:16:42.83,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Hm... I feel like Thaiti's side is \Nmessier than when we started somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.83,0:16:44.60,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,So you really are an oaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:46.23,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Here's a hanky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.23,0:16:48.74,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,No! This was just an accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:53.18,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Also, why does my side have \Na chimney?! That's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.18,0:16:55.48,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You picked the sides, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.26,0:16:59.09,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,A-Anyway, this round doesn't count!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.09,0:16:59.87,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,It doesn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.36,0:17:04.13,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Fine. I guess I'll have to go through \Nwith this until she's satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.13,0:17:05.88,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Next! Onto the next!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.88,0:17:08.38,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,LAUNDRY BATTLE
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.65,0:17:10.02,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,JAHI
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:11.40,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THAITI
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.39,0:17:08.38,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Laundry battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.54,0:17:12.64,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.64,0:17:15.39,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,SEWING BATTLE
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.86,0:17:15.39,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Sewing battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.65,0:17:17.07,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,JAHI
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.53,0:17:20.14,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THAITI
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.17,0:17:20.14,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.54,0:17:23.40,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,DIY battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.14,0:17:23.40,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,DIY BATTLE
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.71,0:17:33.19,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Why can you do all this \Nstuff, you dumb meathead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:34.37,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Who are you calling "meathead"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.30,0:17:38.07,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Chores don't phase me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.07,0:17:42.30,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is nothing compared to what \NI endured during magic training.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.79,0:17:44.49,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You should just give up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.49,0:17:45.88,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.22,0:17:49.00,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,I'm going to be the one \Nto take care of Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.56,0:17:49.90,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,GURGLE...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.11,0:17:54.00,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.70,0:17:56.86,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Next is a cooking battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.65,0:17:59.51,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Om...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.18,0:18:02.35,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.69,0:18:05.40,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Ah, this is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.22,0:18:08.47,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Well done, Thaiti!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.22,0:18:10.90,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,I know, right? It is, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.23,0:18:12.98,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Oh, there's plenty more, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.98,0:18:16.02,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I see. Isn't that wonderful, Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.02,0:18:16.78,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.47,0:18:21.41,italics,THAITI,0,0,0,,I see. I guess I can cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.41,0:18:24.87,italics,THAITI,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I did \Nhelp Mom cook pretty often.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.87,0:18:26.80,italics,THAITI,0,0,0,,I totally forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.80,0:18:27.17,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.51,0:18:34.13,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,What... is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:37.47,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,W-Well, I may have burnt it a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:39.56,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,but what's important is the taste!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.46,0:18:42.78,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.78,0:18:44.60,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Let's have a taste...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.21,0:18:52.97,Default,JAHI/THAITI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.97,0:18:55.70,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,What the heck, Jahi?! What \Ndid you even put in that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.93,0:19:00.33,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Er, um... This shouldn't have \Nhappened... Lady Doux?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.34,0:19:03.83,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,She's not even touching it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.32,0:19:09.10,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Well, this is a surprise. I had \Nno idea you can't cook, Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.58,0:19:11.00,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Okay, Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.43,0:19:16.29,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,I want you to decide on your attendant \Njudging from this cooking battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.29,0:19:16.80,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.03,0:19:18.55,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux gets to decide?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.77,0:19:22.06,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Well, I don't think His Majesty \Ncan make any decisions right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.74,0:19:24.06,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.01,0:19:27.44,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.22,0:19:32.86,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,And I finally felt like I was doing \Nokay as her attendant the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.75,0:19:34.80,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.50,0:19:39.33,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,And I'll lose my position as attendant\N because of some cooking?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.33,0:19:40.07,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.30,0:19:41.45,italics,THAITI,0,0,0,,I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.45,0:19:43.95,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,What's an attendant?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.95,0:19:46.33,Default,BOTH,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.61,0:19:49.27,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Oh, I know what an atranatrana is, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.27,0:19:50.59,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You hit those like a xylophone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.64,0:19:58.57,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,ATTENDANT
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.26,0:19:53.39,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We're talking about an \Nattendant! An attendant!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.39,0:19:55.25,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,The one who's always by your side
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.25,0:19:58.73,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,and takes care of you and \Nteaches you a bunch of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.73,0:19:59.59,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.19,0:20:03.47,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hm... But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.47,0:20:06.48,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,There's training... and pranks...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.69,0:20:08.61,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux likes both!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.61,0:20:13.29,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I want both of my big \Nsisters to teach me those.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.29,0:20:16.36,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,So I don't want either \Nof you to go away...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.36,0:20:18.11,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Never ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.51,0:20:19.88,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.88,0:20:21.24,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.01,0:20:27.50,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Om!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.26,0:20:31.79,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux! You don't need to \Nforce yourself to eat that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.79,0:20:35.00,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Yeah! You saw how much \NHis Majesty suffered!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.29,0:20:38.51,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yum.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.91,0:20:39.74,Default,JAHI/THAITI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.98,0:20:43.56,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I love sweet potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.56,0:20:47.11,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,It tastes like potatoes and sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.11,0:20:49.27,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,This was supposed to be \Na sweet potato dessert?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.86,0:20:54.00,flashback,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux's favorite foods...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.00,0:20:57.54,flashback,JAHI,0,0,0,,Sweet potatoes... and dark matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.94,0:21:00.10,flashback,JAHI,0,0,0,,I guess she did mention it's sweet before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.09,0:21:02.66,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.29,0:21:06.66,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You remembered my favorite foods!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.79,0:21:11.73,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,N-No, this was just a coincidence...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.73,0:21:13.25,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Seconds, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.78,0:21:14.75,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.79,0:21:19.40,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Looks like the competition was a tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.40,0:21:20.90,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,I won't accept this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.51,0:21:25.76,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep challenging \Nyou until I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.91,0:21:35.02,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Or so she said as she ran off, but \Nshe hasn't made a peep since.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.43,0:21:38.08,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What in the world is she\Nup to, I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.86,0:21:42.60,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ah! What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.60,0:21:46.78,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I don't remember this cafeteria \Nbeing so popular before...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.33,0:21:50.05,Default,DEMON A,0,0,0,,What is this? It's super tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.05,0:21:52.11,Default,DEMON B,0,0,0,,I've never eaten anything \Nlike this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.11,0:21:56.42,Default,DEMON C,0,0,0,,You can't be serious! Who \Nmade this delicious food?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.61,0:22:00.01,Default,CHEF,0,0,0,,You've got some skills, missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.40,0:22:06.14,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,Thaiti was scouted by the \Ncook at the demon castle's cafeteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.69,0:22:10.02,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,I've finally found the perfect job for me!
